---
source: crates/holst-cli/src/table.rs
expression: help_of(line)
---
List, download and restore board backups.

USAGE
  holst backup <command> [flags]

COMMANDS
  ls:          List a board's backups with keys and dates
  get:         Download a backup by its key
  restore:     Write a backup back into its board

EXAMPLES
  $ holst backup ls "Roadmap"
  $ holst backup restore "Roadmap" <key>
